 Because the offer enters every outcome regression as a control,
 the WTP coefficient that identifies screening is estimated net of the anchor and is essentially unchanged whether or not the offer is included.
 Because the offer was randomized independently of the discount,
 it is orthogonal to the sunk-cost assignment (
