\begin_layout Standard
Table 1 in the main text reports balance for the village-level discount randomization.
 This appendix reports the corresponding checks for the second randomization:
 the initial offer price presented at the start of the bargaining game,
 which was randomized at the individual level.
 Table
\begin_inset space ~
\end_inset


\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "tab:offer-balance"

\end_inset

 reports,
 for each baseline covariate in Table 1,
 the coefficient from a regression of the covariate on the randomly assigned offer price.
 None of the covariates is related to the offer price at the 5 percent level.
 A joint test that regresses the offer price on all covariates does not reject orthogonality (F(11,693)=1.51,
 p=0.13);
 the corresponding joint test for the discount randomization is also insignificant (F(11,693)=1.33,
 p=0.21).
\end_layout

